<title>MEXICO: CYCLING-LONGO SMASHES WORLD ONE-HOUR RECORD.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LONGO SMASHES WORLD ONE-HOUR RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cyclist Jeannie Longo shattered the women's world one-hour cycling record on Saturday, covering a distance of 48.159 km.</p>
<p>It easily beat the previous record of 47.411 km set by Briton Yvonne McGregor in Manchester, England on June 17, 1995.</p>
